@title Place palette: real symbols in categories, detail pane, keyboard and mouse
@area Schematic
# Lane V5 of the visual redesign (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 7).
# Q opens the place palette: categories on the left, the symbols as drawings
# in the middle, the selected symbol large with its pins on the right.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key q
wait 8
expect "Favourites"
expect "Circuits"
expect "Contacts"
shot start
check_layout
click_text Contacts
wait 8
expect "Pins"
expect "Standard"
shot contacts
text coil
wait 8
shot search-coil
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
